verse = \lyricmode {
  Hope in the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord," } O na -- tion!
With him is stead -- fast love,
and he with full sal -- va -- tion
will bless you from a -- bove.
The \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } will in com -- pas -- sion
for Is -- ra -- el a -- tone;
yes, from all their trans -- gres -- sion
he will re -- deem his own.
}
